; cur:C is a regular expression on the commodity of each amount, case-insensitive, with ^ and $
; put around it. z holds one amount of every commodity (it is elided).
2026-01-01 many commodities
    a:x       1 X
    a:xy      2 XY
    a:lx      3 x
    a:usd     4 $
    a:ef      5 "E F"
    a:plus    6 "A+B"
    a:dot     7 "A.B"
    a:axb     8 AXB
    a:eur     9 EUR
    a:euro   10 €
    a:digit  11 "2X"
    a:dash   13 "A-B"
    a:ab     14 AB
    z
